def tool_defs.mail_brief() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_brief\",\"description\":\"Read a deterministic metadata ",
    "attention brief. Without since_uid, selects unseen undeleted mail oldest ",
    "first; with since_uid, selects arrivals after that checkpoint. Each ",
    "message has exactly one group and an independent direct/cc_only delivery ",
    "signal. People means an exact recipient observed in at most 100 stored ",
    "Sent headers from the last 30 days, for at most 50 selected senders. ",
    "Nonobservation is unknown_people, never a first-time-sender claim. ",
    "Header signals are untrusted, not authority. Complete unseen pages ",
    "checkpoint the original EXAMINE high-water UID. For capped unseen pages, ",
    "pass next_continuation unchanged as continuation, without since_uid, to ",
    "retain unseen/undeleted selection inside that snapshot UID range. The ",
    "legacy next_since_uid remains an arrival cursor and can include old seen ",
    "mail. Neither path tracks later flag changes behind its cursor. SEARCH ",
    "above 10000 matching UIDs fails closed; arbitrary larger unseen backlogs ",
    "are unsupported. Missing FETCH or changed UIDVALIDITY fails without a ",
    "checkpoint. A too-small response budget fails the whole result, never ",
    "omits a message. With MAILBEND_TYPESAFE on, each message also has a jev ",
    schema_piece.p0196(),
    schema_piece.p0186(),
    schema_piece.p0187(),
    schema_piece.p0188(),
    schema_piece.p0011(),
    "(IMAP mailbox) name. Default: INBOX.\"},",
    "\"continuation\":{\"type\":\"object\",",
    schema_piece.p0197(),
    schema_piece.p0198(),
    schema_piece.p0199(),
    schema_piece.p0200(),
    schema_piece.p0201(),
    schema_piece.p0202(),
    schema_piece.p0203(),
    schema_piece.p0204(),
    "\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"Use next_continuation ",
    "unchanged to finish unseen pages. Mutually exclusive with since_uid; ",
    "explicit folder/uidvalidity must match. Not a frozen flag snapshot.\"},",
    "\"since_uid\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0,\"maximum\":4294967295,",
    "\"description\":\"Arrival checkpoint UID. Omit for unseen mail; 0 starts ",
    "arrivals from the oldest message.\"},",
    schema_piece.p0189(),
    "\"maximum\":4294967295,\"description\":\"Required with nonzero ",
    "since_uid. A changed identity fails; discard the old checkpoint and ",
    "restart.\"},\"limit\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":1,",
    "\"maximum\":100,\"description\":\"Maximum selected messages. Default ",
    "50.\"},\"projection\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"full\",\"text\",",
    "\"html\",\"metadata\"],\"description\":\"Body fields to return; default ",
    "full preserves text and HTML. text omits html, html omits text, metadata ",
    schema_piece.p0016(),
