def tool_defs.mail_send() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_send\",\"description\":\"Compose and send a message ",
    "over SMTP (verified TLS). From is MAILBEND_EMAIL. A send is refused, and ",
    "nothing is sent, when a recipient is not in MAILBEND_ALLOWED_RECIPIENTS ",
    "or the MAILBEND_MAX_SENDS_PER_DAY limit is reached. With ",
    "MAILBEND_SAVE_SENT the result's sent_copy says whether a copy was saved ",
    "to the Sent folder; a failed copy does not fail the send. SMTP attempts ",
    "report smtp_outcome (accepted, not_sent, unknown), smtp_phase, ",
    "smtp_reason and next_action. Accepted means accepted by the SMTP server, ",
    "not recipient delivery. Never automatically retry unknown; a missing ",
    "Sent copy does not prove non-delivery. With MAILBEND_TYPESAFE on, the ",
    "message is first scanned locally for secrets, then checked by Jev; a ",
    "secret, unreadable text, a Jev block or a TypeSafe failure stops the ",
    "send (the result has secret_scan and jev). Saving a draft ",
    schema_piece.p0391(),
    schema_piece.p0392(),
