def tool_defs.mail_reply() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_reply\",\"description\":\"Reply to a message (sets ",
    "In-Reply-To/References, quotes the original). Sends unless as_draft is ",
    "true. Only the first 256 KB of the original is read: the result reports ",
    "quoted_original_truncated, quoted_bytes and original_bytes, and a ",
    "truncated quote also says so in the text. A send is refused, and nothing ",
    "is sent, when a recipient is not in MAILBEND_ALLOWED_RECIPIENTS or the ",
    "MAILBEND_MAX_SENDS_PER_DAY limit is reached. With MAILBEND_SAVE_SENT the ",
    "result's sent_copy says whether a copy was saved to the Sent folder; a ",
    "failed copy does not fail the send. SMTP attempts report smtp_outcome ",
    "(accepted, not_sent, unknown), smtp_phase, smtp_reason and next_action. ",
    "Accepted means accepted by the SMTP server, not recipient delivery. ",
    "Never automatically retry unknown; a missing Sent copy does not prove ",
    "non-delivery. With MAILBEND_TYPESAFE on, the message is first scanned ",
    "locally for secrets, then checked by Jev; a secret, unreadable text, a ",
    "Jev block or a TypeSafe failure stops the send (the result has ",
    "secret_scan and jev). Saving a draft (mail_save_draft) is never checked ",
    "by Jev. Outgoing subject, body, display names and attachment filenames ",
    "report hidden_unicode counts (tag, bidi, zero_width). Caller tag ",
    "characters outside valid emoji tag sequences and bidi controls in ",
    "filenames refuse both sends and drafts before composition. Emoji tag ",
    "validity uses pinned CLDR 49 identifiers, not only RGI flags. Other bidi ",
    "and zero-width text remains allowed; LRM and RLM count in both ",
    "categories. Encoded-word-looking filenames are serialized literally with ",
    "RFC 2231 and a safe ASCII fallback. Replies and forwards remove invalid ",
    "inherited tags from copied text and display names and report ",
    "removed_tags separately; the attached original .eml is unchanged.\",",
    schema_piece.p0010(),
    schema_piece.p0011(),
    schema_piece.p0118(),
    schema_piece.p0119(),
    schema_piece.p0273(),
    schema_piece.p0274(),
    schema_piece.p0275(),
    "\"body\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reply_all\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",",
    "\"description\":\"Also answer the original To and Cc. Default false.\"},",
    schema_piece.p0432(),
    schema_piece.p0350(),
    "<name@example.com>\\\".\"},\"attachments\":{\"type\":\"array\",",
    "\"description\":\"Files to attach. Only regular files inside ",
    "MAILBEND_ATTACH_DIR are allowed; attachments are off when it is not ",
    "set.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"path\"],",
    "\"additionalProperties\":false,",
    schema_piece.p0363(),
    schema_piece.p0364(),
    schema_piece.p0365(),
    schema_piece.p0366(),
    schema_piece.p0367(),
    schema_piece.p0368(),
