def tool_defs.mail_forward() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_forward\",\"description\":\"Forward a message, attached ",
    "whole as a .eml file. Sends unless as_draft is true. A send is refused, ",
    "and nothing is sent, when a recipient is not in ",
    "MAILBEND_ALLOWED_RECIPIENTS or the MAILBEND_MAX_SENDS_PER_DAY limit is ",
    "reached. With MAILBEND_SAVE_SENT the result's sent_copy says whether a ",
    "copy was saved to the Sent folder; a failed copy does not fail the send. ",
    "SMTP attempts report smtp_outcome (accepted, not_sent, unknown), ",
    "smtp_phase, smtp_reason and next_action. Accepted means accepted by the ",
    "SMTP server, not recipient delivery. Never automatically retry unknown; ",
    "a missing Sent copy does not prove non-delivery. With MAILBEND_TYPESAFE ",
    "on, the message is first scanned locally for secrets, then checked by ",
    "Jev; a secret, unreadable text, a Jev block or a TypeSafe failure stops ",
    "the send (the result has secret_scan and jev). Saving a draft ",
    schema_piece.p0391(),
    schema_piece.p0392(),
    schema_piece.p0393(),
    schema_piece.p0394(),
    schema_piece.p0395(),
    schema_piece.p0396(),
    schema_piece.p0397(),
    schema_piece.p0342(),
    schema_piece.p0343(),
    schema_piece.p0344(),
    schema_piece.p0345(),
    schema_piece.p0011(),
    schema_piece.p0118(),
    schema_piece.p0119(),
    schema_piece.p0273(),
    schema_piece.p0274(),
    schema_piece.p0275(),
    "\"to\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},",
    schema_piece.p0350(),
    "<name@example.com>\\\".\"},\"cc\":{\"type\":\"array\",",
    schema_piece.p0347(),
    schema_piece.p0348(),
    schema_piece.p0432(),
    schema_piece.p0350(),
    "<name@example.com>\\\".\"},\"body\":{\"type\":\"string\",",
    "\"description\":\"Note above the forwarded message.\"},",
    schema_piece.p0359(),
    schema_piece.p0360(),
    schema_piece.p0361(),
    schema_piece.p0362(),
    schema_piece.p0363(),
    schema_piece.p0364(),
    schema_piece.p0365(),
    schema_piece.p0366(),
    schema_piece.p0367(),
    schema_piece.p0368(),
    schema_piece.p0433(),
    schema_piece.p0434(),
